{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim island on which you will manage a small team of exiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control over exiles and manage their physical and mental well-being. Craft, buy, or find equipment by exploring to help you survive until the light of a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/exploration.gif?t=1750084349\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make full use of the unique mechanics of the new health and psyche system based on grid. Discover different weapons with their unique attacks. Choose from four different attack types: firearm, melee, throwable and placeable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/combat.gif?t=1750084349\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on quests, trade with wandering merchants, master new skills and listen to your characters stories, thoughts and fears - and at day's end, set up camp to rest and prepare for tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/dialogues.gif?t=1750084349\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unique turn-based combat system built upon grids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fight against bosses and different kinds of Affects - physical manifestations of emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">experience a captivating story and encounter NPCs in side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">build a team from the selection of 9 different characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">explore an open world island with places to uncover ancient secrets and find treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">find and use a great variety of different items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">discover each character's personality and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">collect ingredients and craft various items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">listen to your characters' stories through a huge amount of lines of dialogues and monologues</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757650?t=1750084349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/7c5640b598aa5b3269294e684eb8f16114469569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750084349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/2aad651d9c161156557c78eaae73ead1646097e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750084349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/2aad651d9c161156557c78eaae73ead1646097e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750084349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persevere is a turn-based survival RPG set on a grim island on which you will manage a small team of exiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control over exiles and manage their physical and mental well-being. Craft, buy, or find equipment by exploring to help you survive until the light of a new day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757650/extras/exploration.gif?t=1750084349\" /></div></p><h2 